<title>USA: NY cert cotton stocks fall 7,469 bales to 111,466.</title>
<headline>NY cert cotton stocks fall 7,469 bales to 111,466.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 25 totaled 111,466 bales, down from 118,935 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 7,469 cancellations, and 2,800 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
